Z||000001||Songman||07-22-2001||03:17 AM||||Just go to Search up in the top right corner and type in the users name if you know it, or even a partial name. You will get a list of threads that the user has participated in. Find a post by the user and click the top left icon about the post and you will see his profile that lists an e-mail address if one is available.<P>Mach10 is always around here and not generally hard to find.<P>------------------<BR> <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/uploads/songman_1.gif"> <BR><A HREF="http://members.home.com/tnfieros" TARGET=_blank>Tennessee Fiero Owners</A>||||reg||1
