Z||000003||Mach10||07-22-2001||01:33 PM||||Hey! What's up? You're the guy with the Silver 85GT I met on Main, right? Welcome in. Funny, yesterday was like the only day that I'm NOT scouring for new posts every 4 minutes... I stopped after 8, and went out party'ing. <BR>Now that you've found the forum, feel free to stay a while.  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/smile.gif"><P>If you have technical questions, do a search under the technical posts and archives (unless you like being flamed by the grumpy lifers here  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/tongue.gif">). If you do not see what you require, slap up a new post with a question. just be sure to specify what engine/trans year/model.<P>The other 'peggers on this forum, to my knowledge are:<BR>baldlobo<BR>ferrari_cdn<BR>I think there were a couple more, but I can't remember the usernames  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/biggrin.gif"><P>Again, welcome in!||||reg||6
